must give us pause...

1418
01:30:52,047 --> 01:30:53,982
Dad!

1419
01:30:58,053 --> 01:30:59,321
Oh...

1420
01:30:59,688 --> 01:31:01,423
Mum left you.

1421
01:31:01,590 --> 01:31:02,925
Why didn't you tell me?

1422
01:31:04,259 --> 01:31:06,228
Nothing worse
than a man seeking pity.

1423
01:31:07,429 --> 01:31:10,198
Apart from a bad actor
playing a man seeking pity.

1424
01:31:11,734 --> 01:31:13,335
I love you, Dad.

1425
01:31:15,704 --> 01:31:17,506
In that case...

1426
01:31:17,873 --> 01:31:19,808
I love me too.

1427
01:31:22,277 --> 01:31:24,613
I'm not quite sure
why I'm alive.

1428
01:31:24,780 --> 01:31:26,081
The cane toad!

1429
01:31:30,085 --> 01:31:32,755
Well, this seems like a good
moment for Shakespeare.

1430
01:31:34,022 --> 01:31:35,457
Go on then.

1431
01:31:39,127 --> 01:31:41,597
Doubt thou the stars are fire.

1432
01:31:42,130 --> 01:31:45,100
Doubt that the sun doth move.

1433
